This directory contains the build variant + runtime config for the c.chat
distribution of the desktop app (see ADR-0002: full rebrand, no Element
trademark usage).

- build.json  : electron-builder variant (appId chat.cdot.desktop, productName
                "c.chat", cchat icons). Consumed by ../electron-builder.ts via
                VARIANT_PATH=cchat/build.json.
- config.json : the config.json packed into webapp.asar for desktop builds.
                Mirrors apps/web/config.json plus desktop-only keys
                (help_url, web_base_url). It deliberately contains NO
                "update_base_url": the desktop app's updater is therefore
                disabled (electron-main logs "No update_base_url is defined:
                auto update is disabled"). Do NOT copy Element's
                update_base_url here — pulling updates from a feed we do not
                control is a security problem. Set update_base_url only once
                a c.chat-operated update server exists.
- icons/      : placeholder "c." icons (icon.icns / icon.ico / icon.png),
                generated in-house; no Element artwork.

See ../CCHAT-BUILD.md for the full build procedure.
